{
  "id": "doc-apology",
  "brand": "doc",
  "title": "DOC Apology",
  "category": "ads",
  "purpose": "scroll-stopper",
  "description": "A Bold apology for interrupting, a tagline and the lockup in a solid block off the corner",
  "useWhen": "a wry interruption fits the moment (\"Sorry to interrupt your charting…\").",
  "notWhen": "the piece needs a CTA (this one has none).",
  "paperFileId": "01M4GYN0DT5HC9MZK7YVRYA3CW",
  "guidance": [
    "headline: the apology, three short lines (\"Sorry to interrupt / your charting, but / it's the only time\"). headline-end: its last line without the full stop (\"you're sitting down\"); the full stop is the design's.",
    "tagline: one line that says what DOC offers (\"Learn the numbers between patients.\").",
    "Copy in US English, in the DOC voice: plain, specific, second person, no exclamation marks. Never invent a figure, price, date, module count, quote or name.",
    "Themes: Foundations, Startup and Acquisition are the three tracks (red, purple, green grounds): use the one the piece is about, never mix tracks. Dark and Light are neutral, for the collective as a whole."
  ],
